   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Hi Leandro,<div><br></div><div>Size controls the size of the bar border.  You want to modify the width.</div><div><br></div><div>Hadley</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, Jan 5, 2010 at 7:00 PM, Leandro Marino <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">leandr...@leandromarino.com.br</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\n\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\n\n<div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">Hadley,</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">Thanks a lot for the explanation.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">May I ask you another thing?</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">I want to do an bar plot with de size of the bars thinner\n(smaller) than de default. I tried geom_bar(size=1), geom._bar(size=0), geom._bar(size=0.1)\nbut nothing occurs.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">What am I doing wrong?</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">Thanks in advance</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">Regards,</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">Marino, Leandro</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\n\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #b5c4df 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">De:</span></b><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a>\n[mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a>] <b>Em nome de </b>hadley wickham<br>\n<b>Enviada em:</b> terça-feira, 5 de janeiro de 2010 19:31<br>\n<b>Para:</b> Leandro Marino<br>\n<b>Cc:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\n<b>Assunto:</b> Re: xlab and ylab</span></p>\n\n</div><div><div></div><div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Use the theme settings axis.title.x and axis.title.y.</p>\n\n<div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\">Hadley</p>\n\n<div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">2010/1/5 Leandro Marino &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lea...@cesgranrio.org.br</a>&gt;</p>\n\n<div style=\"margin-left:37.5pt;margin-top:15.0pt\">\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"1600\" height=\"3\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/attach/79c93054cfc0e63b/image001.jpg?part=0.1\"></span></p>\n\n<div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\"> Hi,</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">Anybody knows how can  change de\nfont family, size, and other parameters of the ylab and xlab?</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">This is an\nexample of my plot:</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:37.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">library(ggplot2)</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:37.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">posx &lt;-\ntheme_text(angle=45,hjust=1,face=&#39;bold&#39;,size=12)</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:37.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">posy &lt;-\ntheme_text(angle=0,hjust=1,face=&#39;bold&#39;,size=12)</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:37.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\"> </span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:37.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">y1 &lt;- c(1,4,6,1,8,10,6,1,5,4)</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:37.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\"> </span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:37.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">x &lt;-\nqplot(x=factor(paste(&#39;nomes&#39;,1:10),labels=paste(&#39;nomes&#39;,1:10)),</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:37.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">       y=\ny1 , label=y1,</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:37.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">      \ngeom=&#39;bar&#39;,margins=F, stat=&quot;identity&quot;,xlab=&#39;&#39;,ylab=&#39;Y Label&#39;)</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:37.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">x &lt;- x +\nopts(axis.text.x=posx,axis.text.y=posy) + geom_bar(fill=c(rgb(000,100,000,maxColorValue=255),rep(rgb(110,139,061,maxColorValue=255),9)))</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">x +\ngeom_text(hjust=.5,vjust=-.3,size=4.5)</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\"> </span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">I want to put ylab with size = 14, face\n= ‘bold’</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">Thanks for any advance.</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">Regards,</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">Leandro Marino</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"> </span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"color:black\">Atenciosamente,<br>\n</span><b><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#000040\">Leandro Lins\nMarino</span></b><b><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#000040\"><br>\n</span></b><i><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:gray\">Centro de\nAvaliação<br>\nFundação CESGRANRIO<br>\nRua Santa Alexandrina, 1011 - 2º andar<br>\nRio de Janeiro, RJ - CEP: 20261-903<br>\n</span></i><i><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Wingdings;color:gray\">(</span></i><i><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:gray\"> (21)\n2103-9600 R.:236 <br>\n</span></i><i><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Wingdings;color:gray\">(</span></i><i><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:gray\">\n(21) 8777-7907</span></i><i><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:gray\"><br>\n</span></i><i><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Wingdings;color:gray\">*</span></i><i><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:gray\">\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lea...@cesgranrio.org.br</a></span></i><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\"> </span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#408080\">&quot;Aquele que suporta o peso da sociedade<br>\n    é precisamente aquele que obtém<br>\n as menores vantagens&quot;. (SMITH, Adam)</span></i><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#408080\"><br>\n<br>\n</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Webdings;color:#76923c\">P</span><b><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Palatino Linotype&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#76923c\">  </span></b><b><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#76923c\">Antes de imprimir</span></b><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#76923c\"> <b>pense em sua\nresponsabilidade e compromisso com o</b> <b>MEIO AMBIENTE</b></span><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\"> </span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\"> </span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Consolas;color:black\">Esta mensagem, incluindo seus anexos, pode conter informacoes\nprivilegiadas e/ou de carater confidencial, nao podendo ser retransmitida sem\nautorizacao do remetente. Se voce nao e o destinatario ou pessoa autorizada a\nrecebe-la, informamos que o seu uso, divulgacao, copia ou arquivamento sao\nproibidos. </span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Consolas;color:black\">Portanto, se você recebeu esta mensagem por engano, por favor, nos\ninforme respondendo imediatamente a este e-mail e em seguida apague-a.</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n</div>\n\n<p><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\"> </span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"></span></p>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">-- <br>\nYou received this message because you are 