     1,
     "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\n\n<div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Hadley,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Thanks a lot for the explanation.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">May I ask you another thing?<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">I want to do an bar plot with de size of the bars thinner\n(smaller) than de default. I tried geom_bar(size=1), geom._bar(size=0), geom._bar(size=0.1)\nbut nothing occurs.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">What am I doing wrong?<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Thanks in advance<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,