     3,
     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\n\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #b5c4df 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">De:</span></b><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a>\n[mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a>] <b>Em nome de </b>hadley wickham<br>\n<b>Enviada em:</b> terça-feira, 5 de janeiro de 2010 19:31<br>\n<b>Para:</b> Leandro Marino<br>\n<b>Cc:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\n<b>Assunto:</b> Re: xlab and ylab<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Use the theme settings axis.title.x and axis.title.y.<u></u><u></u></p>\n\n<div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\">Hadley<u></u><u></u></p>\n\n<div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">2010/1/5 Leandro Marino &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lea...@cesgranrio.org.br</a>&gt;<u></u><u></u></p>\n\n<div style=\"margin-left:37.5pt;margin-top:15.0pt\">\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"1600\" height=\"3\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/attach/686cd58cd1c9e427/image001.jpg?part=0.1\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\"> Hi,</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">Anybody knows how can  change de\nfont family, size, and other parameters of the ylab and xlab?</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">This is an\nexample of my plot:</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:37.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">library(ggplot2)</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:37.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">posx &lt;-\ntheme_text(angle=45,hjust=1,face=&#39;bold&#39;,size=12)</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:37.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">posy &lt;-\ntheme_text(angle=0,hjust=1,face=&#39;bold&#39;,size=12)</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:37.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\"> </span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:37.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">y1 &lt;- c(1,4,6,1,8,10,6,1,5,4)</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:37.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\"> </span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:37.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">x &lt;-\nqplot(x=factor(paste(&#39;nomes&#39;,1:10),labels=paste(&#39;nomes&#39;,1:10)),</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:37.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">       y=\ny1 , label=y1,</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:37.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">      \ngeom=&#39;bar&#39;,margins=F, stat=&quot;identity&quot;,xlab=&#39;&#39;,ylab=&#39;Y Label&#39;)</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:37.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">x &lt;- x +\nopts(axis.text.x=posx,axis.text.y=posy) + geom_bar(fill=c(rgb(000,100,000,maxColorValue=255),rep(rgb(110,139,061,maxColorValue=255),9)))</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">x +\ngeom_text(hjust=.5,vjust=-.3,size=4.5)</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\"> </span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">I want to put ylab with size = 14, face\n= ‘bold’</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">Thanks for any advance.</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">Regards,</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\">Leandro Marino</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"> </span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"color:black\">Atenciosamente,<br>\n</span><b><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#000040\">Leandro Lins\nMarino</span></b><b><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#000040\"><br>\n</span></b><i><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:gray\">Centro de\nAvaliação<br>\nFundação CESGRANRIO<br>\nRua Santa Alexandrina, 1011 - 2º andar<br>\nRio de Janeiro, RJ - CEP: 20261-903<br>\n</span></i><i><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Wingdings;color:gray\">(</span></i><i><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:gray\"> (21)\n2103-9600 R.:236 <br>\n</span></i><i><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Wingdings;color:gray\">(</span></i><i><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:gray\">\n(21) 8777-7907</span></i><i><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:gray\"><br>\n</span></i><i><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Wingdings;color:gray\">*</span></i><i><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:gray\">\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lea...@cesgranrio.org.br</a></span></i><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\"> </span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#408080\">&quot;Aquele que suporta o peso da sociedade<br>\n    é precisamente aquele que obtém<br>\n as menores vantagens&quot;. (SMITH, Adam)</span></i><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#408080\"><br>\n<br>\n</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:Webdings;color:#76923c\">P</span><b><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Palatino Linotype&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#76923c\">  </span></b><b><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#76923c\">Antes de imprimir</span></b><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#76923c\"> <b>pense em sua\nresponsabilidade e compromisso com o</b> <b>MEIO AMBIENTE</b></span><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\"> </span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\"> </span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Consolas;color:black\">Esta mensagem, incluindo seus anexos, pode conter informacoes\nprivilegiadas e/ou de carater confidencial, nao podendo ser retransmitida sem\nautorizacao do remetente. Se voce nao e o destinatario ou pessoa autorizada a\nrecebe-la, informamos que o seu uso, divulgacao, copia ou arquivamento sao\nproibidos. </span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Consolas;color:black\">Portanto, se você recebeu esta mensagem por engano, por favor, nos\ninforme respondendo imediatamente a este e-mail e em seguida apague-a.</span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n</div>\n\n<p><span lang=\"PT-BR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#006666\"> </span><span lang=\"PT-BR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">-- <br>\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the ggplot2 mailing\nlist.<br>\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\nTo unsubscribe from this group, send email to<br>\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\nFor more options, visit this group at<br>\n<a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792384451527000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0HxvxvSNW8pVTWXSrnQpMR\">http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2</a><u></u><u></u></p>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br>\n<br clear=\"all\">\n<br>\n-- <br>\n<a href=\"http://had.co.nz/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://had.co.nz/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792384451527000&amp;usg=AOvVaw08AKT4MFKLRoumgyppQu0d\">http://had.co.nz/</a><u></u><u></u></p>\n\n</div>\n\n</div></div>"
